# Unslop UI (Prime Fleet)

When the user asks to **unslop**, polish, clean up, or redesign a screen so it stops looking AI-generated, follow the skill at `.cursor/skills/unslop/SKILL.md` (heydamir/unslop, CC BY 4.0 — credit Damir Sokolovsky).

## Scope

- **In scope:** this Prime Fleet plugin UI only.
- **Out of scope:** Sletci / SLE VIP repos (`sle-vip-booking*`). Do not run unslop there.

## Process (summary)

1. Look at the screen (screenshot / browser) before editing.
2. Audit against `references/signs.md`.
3. Propose **direction** (Product / Character / World / Moments / Signature) and wait for confirmation unless the user said to just do it.
4. Fix in nine passes: spacing → color → icons → copy → type → layout → details → visuals → motion.
5. Prefer existing Prime Fleet / brand tokens; do not invent purple-glow template looks.
6. Keep product features and section order; change craft, not scope.

